<http://www.semanticweb.org/admin/ontologies/2022/7/MIO:00000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Necrosis of the myocardium, as a result of interruption of the blood supply to the area.\n\nA condition which occurs when blood flow decreases or stops to a part of the heart, causing damage to the heart muscle.\n\nGross necrosis of the myocardium, as a result of interruption of the blood supply to the area, as in coronary thrombosis.\n\nA disorder characterized by gross necrosis of the myocardium; this is due to an interruption of blood supply to the area. [url:http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C27996]" .
